WEBVTT

01:40.040 --> 01:43.160
SHEN RESIDENCE

01:45.320 --> 01:46.280
A bet?

01:46.840 --> 01:47.680
Yes.

01:47.760 --> 01:50.240
Not only did she say whoever loses
must kneel and apologize,

01:50.840 --> 01:52.760
but the loser must go back
to Zhennv Hall too.

01:53.320 --> 01:54.960
Such boasting makes me wonder

01:55.040 --> 01:56.800
if she's lost her mind.

01:57.280 --> 01:58.960
At first, I was worried

01:59.040 --> 02:00.600
that she might be Xue Fangfei

02:00.680 --> 02:01.720
coming back for revenge.

02:01.800 --> 02:03.480
But now, I feel relieved.

02:04.120 --> 02:05.520
With a brain like hers,

02:05.600 --> 02:06.800
she's not like Xue Fangfei

02:07.400 --> 02:09.440
apart from her appearance.

02:10.000 --> 02:11.400
She's so arrogant.

02:12.000 --> 02:13.880
She even dares make a bet with Mr. Li.

02:14.920 --> 02:16.680
Doesn't she know their capabilities?

02:16.760 --> 02:17.760
That's enough.

02:18.560 --> 02:19.960
I don't want to hear it.

02:20.040 --> 02:20.880
Yurong,

02:20.960 --> 02:22.160
what's wrong with you lately?

02:22.240 --> 02:23.280
You're always unhappy.

02:24.320 --> 02:25.160
It's nothing.

02:26.160 --> 02:27.960
I've got my hands full
at the Hanlin Academy.

02:28.960 --> 02:30.040
I'm just a little tired.

02:30.920 --> 02:32.120
Go and study.

02:32.200 --> 02:33.880
Don't tell me you're worried
about Jiang Li.

02:33.960 --> 02:35.080
Shen Ruyun!

02:38.040 --> 02:39.040
Don't be insolent.

02:40.320 --> 02:41.760
What did I do?

02:44.480 --> 02:45.600
Mother wants me to ask

02:46.480 --> 02:47.440
if you want

02:47.520 --> 02:49.120
to move back to your room.

02:50.280 --> 02:51.120
After all,

02:51.680 --> 02:54.120
it doesn't seem right
to live in the study.

02:55.080 --> 02:56.440
I'm good here.

02:57.120 --> 02:58.000
Yurong,

02:58.600 --> 03:00.080
you locked your room

03:00.920 --> 03:02.360
and wouldn't let anyone clean it.

03:03.560 --> 03:05.200
You can't go on like this.

03:06.040 --> 03:08.640
How about you give me the key?

03:09.160 --> 03:10.640
Mother and I can clean Xue…

03:13.000 --> 03:14.520
We'll throw away all her belongings.

03:16.440 --> 03:17.840
Then you can move back to your room.

03:20.240 --> 03:21.160
Get out.

06:40.200 --> 06:41.840
The situation has been tense lately.

06:43.160 --> 06:44.200
Just wait a little more.

06:45.480 --> 06:46.640
I'll buy your freedom.

06:51.960 --> 06:53.080
Lonely Gentleman.

06:53.160 --> 06:54.440
You…

06:56.040 --> 06:58.160
Get dressed before talking to me.

07:00.960 --> 07:02.160
Duke Su,

07:02.720 --> 07:03.720
did I commit any crime?

07:04.280 --> 07:06.360
I'm tired of hearing that question.

07:07.040 --> 07:08.720
Is the Bureau of Salt and Iron
out of money?

07:09.280 --> 07:10.840
You can't even buy a girl's freedom.

07:12.360 --> 07:13.360
What did you say?

07:14.040 --> 07:15.040
I don't get it.

07:15.120 --> 07:16.920
Zhiyan, pour some drinks.

07:34.120 --> 07:35.080
You work for him?

07:40.360 --> 07:41.280
What do you want?

07:43.400 --> 07:44.240
What are you doing?

07:44.320 --> 07:45.360
Stay away from me!

07:51.960 --> 07:53.400
Where did Judge Kong channel

07:54.920 --> 07:56.960
the money embezzled
from the Bureau of Salt and Iron?

07:57.040 --> 07:57.960
I don't know.

07:58.520 --> 08:00.680
I may be his brother-in-law,
but I don't know anything.

08:00.760 --> 08:02.320
Why waste time talking to him?

08:02.400 --> 08:05.160
I thought we were here
to try out our new torture device.

08:07.280 --> 08:08.360
What is this?

08:08.440 --> 08:09.400
That's a good question.

08:09.960 --> 08:12.880
It's something
that would turn you into a eunuch.

08:13.360 --> 08:16.560
But it's only one strike
for a real eunuch.

08:17.280 --> 08:18.600
With you,

08:19.440 --> 08:20.960
I might have to put in some effort.

08:21.440 --> 08:22.360
What do you want?

08:22.440 --> 08:23.400
Drinking in a brothel

08:24.000 --> 08:27.080
and giving yourself a pseudonym
like a woman.

08:28.040 --> 08:29.680
Lonely Gentleman,

08:29.760 --> 08:31.960
you will be completely free
from sensations

08:32.039 --> 08:33.480
and desires after this.

08:36.280 --> 08:37.640
I'm not married yet.

08:38.200 --> 08:39.440
I don't have any children.

08:39.520 --> 08:41.280
Fine, I'll tell you.

08:42.200 --> 08:45.080
In my first year, my brother-in-law
wouldn't let me touch any money.

08:45.680 --> 08:47.000
Later on, he thought I was honest,

08:47.600 --> 08:51.520
so he let me transport money.

08:52.480 --> 08:55.120
After getting the money,
we'd deliver it to the theater.

08:55.600 --> 08:57.000
Who did you give it to?

08:57.080 --> 08:57.960
I don't know.

08:59.320 --> 09:00.960
No!

09:01.040 --> 09:02.680
I really don't know.

09:02.760 --> 09:04.640
These are the secrets of the Kong family.

09:04.720 --> 09:06.680
If they're revealed,
their family will be ruined.

09:06.760 --> 09:07.600
He won't tell me.

09:08.520 --> 09:09.760
Give him a piece of paper.

09:11.360 --> 09:12.800
Write down the days

09:12.880 --> 09:14.440
you went to the theater.

09:16.160 --> 09:17.640
If there's any wrong detail…

09:17.720 --> 09:19.520
You'll have no chance to have children.

09:20.440 --> 09:21.960
All right. I'll write them down.

09:27.080 --> 09:27.960
Good job.

09:29.600 --> 09:30.640
I'm not after the money.

09:30.720 --> 09:32.960
Taking this money
will make things easier for you.

09:33.040 --> 09:34.760
Besides, you deserve the money.

09:36.760 --> 09:38.600
I still owe you for your kindness.

09:40.000 --> 09:41.960
If Ms. Yu hadn't saved me back then,

09:42.040 --> 09:43.520
I would have died long ago.

09:44.720 --> 09:45.840
I became your informant

09:46.360 --> 09:48.920
because I hope we can find General Xiao

09:49.000 --> 09:50.800
and Ms. Yu's true cause of death.

09:51.760 --> 09:54.280
My father died in battle
and my mother passed away from illness.

09:54.360 --> 09:56.120
It was confirmed eight years ago.

09:57.280 --> 09:58.600
What else is there to investigate?

09:58.680 --> 10:00.240
Others believe it, but do you?

10:00.720 --> 10:01.720
The more you know,

10:03.360 --> 10:04.280
the faster you die.

10:11.240 --> 10:12.080
I don't believe

10:12.920 --> 10:14.320
you're this heartless.

10:30.640 --> 10:31.840
Come upstairs and take a seat.

10:33.080 --> 10:34.000
Come on.

10:34.480 --> 10:35.600
Mr. Lin, come and catch me.

10:35.680 --> 10:36.680
Come and have fun.

10:37.640 --> 10:38.480
Come.

10:39.000 --> 10:40.160
You're hurting me.

10:50.200 --> 10:53.480
GREAT YAN MILITARY CAMP IN NANJIANG

10:55.360 --> 10:57.160
Father, I want to go with you.

11:03.200 --> 11:04.040
Xiao Heng,

11:04.120 --> 11:05.600
we're going to battle,

11:05.680 --> 11:06.720
not military training.

11:06.800 --> 11:08.400
Then you'll be in grave danger.

11:08.480 --> 11:09.840
Don't worry.

11:09.920 --> 11:11.640
I'll bring the Longwu Army with me.

11:13.520 --> 11:14.360
Wait for my return.

11:16.000 --> 11:16.960
Mother.

11:17.640 --> 11:18.520
Heng'er,

11:18.600 --> 11:19.800
time to go to bed.

11:21.360 --> 11:22.320
No.

11:22.880 --> 11:24.640
I want to be with Father.

11:24.720 --> 11:25.680
Heng'er, be good.

11:25.760 --> 11:27.000
Go to bed.

11:27.080 --> 11:29.280
Mother, please.

11:29.360 --> 11:31.080
Let me go with you.

11:31.640 --> 11:32.640
When I return,

11:32.720 --> 11:33.880
I'll sing songs for you.

11:33.960 --> 11:35.040
I'm not going to bed.

11:35.120 --> 11:36.120
Peng Guang.

11:38.640 --> 11:39.560
PENG GUANG

11:39.640 --> 11:40.600
General.

11:40.680 --> 11:42.680
Bring Xiao Heng to General Xiao tomorrow

11:43.200 --> 11:44.240
at the Duke Mansion.

11:44.320 --> 11:45.240
Yes.

11:46.200 --> 11:47.520
Xiao Heng, come.

11:47.600 --> 11:48.480
I'm not going!

11:49.280 --> 11:50.160
Let me go.

11:55.720 --> 11:56.640
Father.

11:57.440 --> 11:59.040
Mother.

12:00.520 --> 12:03.080
Father!

12:04.680 --> 12:05.600
Father.

12:05.680 --> 12:07.160
Father.

12:07.960 --> 12:11.240
Father, wake up.

12:11.960 --> 12:13.880
Get him out of here.

12:14.520 --> 12:15.480
Father.

12:15.560 --> 12:17.200
Let me go.

12:17.920 --> 12:19.440
Let go!

12:19.520 --> 12:20.360
Father!

12:20.440 --> 12:21.280
That's enough!

12:22.040 --> 12:23.080
Grandfather,

12:23.160 --> 12:25.520
my father would never lose to them.

12:25.600 --> 12:27.400
There's definitely
something fishy about this.

12:27.480 --> 12:29.200
We must look into it.

12:29.280 --> 12:32.120
An official dies for his memorials,
an officer for his battles.

12:32.600 --> 12:37.360
Dying in battle
is the fate of a military officer.

12:37.440 --> 12:39.120
Father's cause of death is unclear.

12:39.200 --> 12:41.880
Grandfather, are you really going
to turn a blind eye?

12:42.880 --> 12:45.600
Victory and defeat are common in war.

12:45.680 --> 12:46.840
I don't understand.

12:46.920 --> 12:49.720
I don't understand
how you can be so heartless.

12:49.800 --> 12:51.120
No wonder Father always said

12:51.200 --> 12:53.040
you were unhappy with him
since he was little.

12:53.120 --> 12:54.680
Even now that he's gone,

12:54.760 --> 12:56.560
you refuse to seek justice for him!

12:56.640 --> 12:57.960
You're heartless!

12:59.120 --> 13:00.240
I hate you!

13:06.080 --> 13:08.480
MEMORIAL TABLET OF THE LATE
GENERAL WHO ASSISTS THE STATE, XIAO

13:09.960 --> 13:11.360
- Hurry up.
- Come.

13:12.080 --> 13:13.440
- Quickly.
- Hurry.

13:14.160 --> 13:16.120
- I said, quickly.
- Hurry up.

13:19.960 --> 13:21.480
Look how handsome he is.

13:21.560 --> 13:22.600
He sure looks handsome.

13:22.680 --> 13:24.440
- Just look at his appearance.
- You're right.

13:25.760 --> 13:28.040
- He's so good-looking. Look.
- Yes.

13:28.680 --> 13:30.000
He has an impressive demeanor.

13:30.920 --> 13:32.880
I really like this gentleman.

13:35.120 --> 13:35.960
Mother.

13:38.960 --> 13:39.800
Mother.

13:40.360 --> 13:41.760
- Madam Yu!
- Mother!

13:41.840 --> 13:42.680
Mother, what's wrong?

13:42.760 --> 13:43.800
Madam Yu.

13:43.880 --> 13:44.840
Mother.

13:44.920 --> 13:46.120
Mother, are you all right?

13:46.200 --> 13:47.560
- Qing'er.
- Mother.

13:48.320 --> 13:49.880
- Madam Yu.
- Get me dressed.

13:54.160 --> 13:55.120
Is it pretty?

13:55.200 --> 13:56.280
Yes.

13:56.760 --> 14:01.400
Heng'er, your father gave me this hairpin.

14:02.880 --> 14:04.560
It's my most cherished possession.

14:05.040 --> 14:05.880
Come.

14:06.680 --> 14:07.520
Put it on me.

14:09.200 --> 14:10.240
Mother,

14:10.720 --> 14:11.680
you look beautiful.

14:14.280 --> 14:15.680
TOMB OF GENERAL XIAO FROM GREAT YAN

14:15.760 --> 14:18.320
Mother, Father's cause of death
is unclear.

14:19.160 --> 14:20.480
They refuse to listen to me.

14:21.280 --> 14:22.720
Heng'er, you're still a child.

14:23.280 --> 14:24.400
You'll understand many things

14:25.320 --> 14:27.040
after you've grown up.

14:29.400 --> 14:33.280
Your father was an upright man.

14:34.560 --> 14:36.080
He has always taken pride in you.

14:37.360 --> 14:38.440
So from now on,

14:39.280 --> 14:41.000
you shouldn't always cry and make a fuss.

14:42.560 --> 14:43.880
Otherwise, your father and I

14:44.840 --> 14:46.360
would feel heartbroken.

14:48.680 --> 14:52.360
I hope you can grow up

14:52.920 --> 14:54.480
safely and happily.

14:55.600 --> 14:56.720
Can you do that?

15:44.320 --> 15:45.440
My lord,

15:45.520 --> 15:46.520
the interrogation is over.

15:46.600 --> 15:48.040
His theater visits are quite regular.

15:48.120 --> 15:49.880
Shall we go
to the theater tomorrow to check?

15:52.480 --> 15:53.320
Sure.

15:54.080 --> 15:56.520
My lord, this is a significant clue.

15:56.600 --> 15:57.480
Aren't you pleased?

15:57.960 --> 15:59.480
His lordship is not in the mood today.

16:01.880 --> 16:03.720
Let me tell you
something interesting then.

16:04.400 --> 16:06.760
Ms. Jiang Li and Li Lian made a bet.

16:06.840 --> 16:09.040
If Jiang Li loses,
she has to return to Zhennv Hall.

16:09.120 --> 16:11.480
If Li Lian loses, he has to become a monk.

16:12.480 --> 16:14.880
I was surprised when I heard it.

16:14.960 --> 16:17.680
I didn't expect Ms. Jiang Li
to be triggered by your provocation.

16:17.760 --> 16:21.840
Is she risking everything
or overestimating herself?

16:23.640 --> 16:27.040
Whether she's a toothless tiger
or a fierce one,

16:29.600 --> 16:30.760
we'll find out soon enough.

16:35.120 --> 16:37.960
FANGFEI COURTYARD

16:50.440 --> 16:51.560
Miss,

16:51.640 --> 16:53.240
is your wrist hurting?

16:54.320 --> 16:55.160
What's wrong?

16:56.640 --> 16:57.560
Why are you crying?

16:58.440 --> 16:59.280
Miss,

16:59.360 --> 17:01.760
I heard about your bet
with the Li brothers.

17:02.680 --> 17:04.560
I'm worried sick.

17:05.119 --> 17:08.240
I just hate that
I couldn't do anything to help you.

17:08.319 --> 17:09.280
It's all right, Tong'er.

17:10.520 --> 17:11.920
I'm quite confident.

17:12.000 --> 17:13.880
Miss, are you really not afraid?

17:14.440 --> 17:16.040
When raising a blade and bringing it down,

17:17.119 --> 17:18.520
just think of nothing.

17:19.680 --> 17:21.359
I must meet His Majesty and be rewarded.

17:22.079 --> 17:24.319
Is it because you want to tell His Majesty

17:25.000 --> 17:27.560
about the injustice
you and her ladyship suffered?

17:28.640 --> 17:30.080
It's still not the right time yet.

17:30.160 --> 17:31.600
Only when I get first place

17:31.680 --> 17:33.880
will Ms. Jiang Li
be truly back in the capital.

17:33.960 --> 17:35.600
Everyone will like me

17:35.680 --> 17:37.840
and won't dare do as they please.

17:37.920 --> 17:40.200
Also, I want to know
who's behind Shen Yurong.

17:40.280 --> 17:41.840
Miss, are you saying

17:42.560 --> 17:43.960
someone is instigating him?

17:45.320 --> 17:47.520
Xue Li, I have no choice.

17:48.120 --> 17:50.280
She could crush us

17:50.360 --> 17:52.440
like ants.

17:52.520 --> 17:53.840
I'm certain of it.

17:56.440 --> 17:59.680
And this person has immense wealth

18:01.280 --> 18:04.680
that can help Shen Yurong rise steadily.

18:07.680 --> 18:09.360
Although I don't know who this person is

18:10.760 --> 18:13.640
or why she's targeting me and my family,

18:15.760 --> 18:18.200
instead of doing everything to find out,

18:18.280 --> 18:20.280
it's better for me to use myself as bait

18:20.360 --> 18:21.440
and lure that person out.

18:22.120 --> 18:26.080
The imperial palace banquet
is a good opportunity.

18:27.600 --> 18:29.840
When I stand up there,

18:30.960 --> 18:32.760
that person must look towards me.

18:36.880 --> 18:39.000
PRINCESS WANNING'S MANSION

18:39.080 --> 18:41.040
CLOSE TO WISDOM AND BENEVOLENCE

18:43.840 --> 18:46.120
What are you writing here?

18:54.840 --> 18:56.400
Your Highness is pressing on my sleeve.

18:59.320 --> 19:00.520
What are you writing?

19:00.600 --> 19:02.040
It's an unnamed inscription

19:02.120 --> 19:03.480
that I've liked practicing lately.

19:05.120 --> 19:06.400
Does Your Highness want to write?

19:07.000 --> 19:08.120
I'll hold the brush for you.

19:08.800 --> 19:09.640
I'll try it.

19:11.360 --> 19:14.720
CLOSE TO WISDOM AND BENEVOLENCE
RESPECT AND ASPIRE FOR VIRTUE

19:15.520 --> 19:16.360
Yurong,

19:17.440 --> 19:21.040
is there anything interesting
out there recently?

19:21.600 --> 19:22.440
Your Highness,

19:23.120 --> 19:25.800
when practicing calligraphy,
you must clear your mind.

19:28.760 --> 19:30.200
You're spouting nonsense again.

19:32.280 --> 19:33.120
Yes.

19:33.680 --> 19:34.600
It's my fault.

19:35.080 --> 19:36.040
Do as you please.

19:36.120 --> 19:38.880
Have you heard about the bet

19:38.960 --> 19:41.120
between Mr. Li Lian and Ms. Jiang Li?

19:43.360 --> 19:44.720
I don't pay attention to these things.

19:44.800 --> 19:47.200
Isn't Ms. Jiang Li the one

19:47.280 --> 19:49.000
who tried to commit
matricide and fratricide?

19:49.080 --> 19:49.960
How is she?

19:50.600 --> 19:51.440
Is she beautiful?

19:58.080 --> 19:58.920
I forgot.

20:04.320 --> 20:06.560
Yurong, you must have been
too busy lately.

20:07.520 --> 20:09.240
Even your memory is foggy.

20:09.320 --> 20:11.160
Didn't you meet her twice?

20:11.240 --> 20:12.440
First, at the Hairpin Ceremony.

20:12.520 --> 20:15.040
- Another time at the Jiang--
- I've never paid attention

20:15.120 --> 20:16.160
to irrelevant people.

20:17.880 --> 20:18.840
That's true.

20:19.640 --> 20:22.600
You only need to pay attention to me.

20:23.160 --> 20:27.520
But Ms. Jiang Li
tried to commit matricide and fratricide.

20:27.600 --> 20:30.040
A woman like her

20:30.120 --> 20:32.120
made a bet with Mr. Li Lian.

20:32.760 --> 20:33.760
Who do you think will win?

20:35.280 --> 20:36.800
Naturally, Mr. Li will win.

20:37.360 --> 20:38.720
You're lying.

20:41.760 --> 20:42.920
You wrote it wrongly.

20:44.200 --> 20:45.400
I'll write another one for you.

20:47.160 --> 20:48.120
There's no need.

20:48.680 --> 20:49.760
You're not clearheaded now.

20:50.320 --> 20:53.040
- What's the point of writing?
- We can surely write another one well.

20:53.560 --> 20:56.120
I said forget it.
Didn't you hear clearly, Shen Yurong?

20:56.760 --> 20:59.000
I'm no longer in the mood
to clear my mind with you.

21:04.360 --> 21:06.520
How can a man who can't even lie

21:07.840 --> 21:09.360
coax me?

21:13.760 --> 21:14.640
I'm incompetent.

21:19.960 --> 21:21.560
Do you think my anger will subside

21:23.040 --> 21:24.080
with an apology?

21:28.440 --> 21:29.560
Meixiang.

21:32.480 --> 21:34.400
Stop looking like
you're wronged in front of me.

21:34.960 --> 21:35.840
Go out and help me bet

21:36.320 --> 21:37.440
on Jiang Li to win.

22:04.720 --> 22:05.600
That's ridiculous!

22:06.080 --> 22:08.680
She's becoming more and more disobedient.

22:08.760 --> 22:10.600
She even dares to make such a bet.

22:17.520 --> 22:19.440
The powers in the capital are complex.

22:19.920 --> 22:21.960
How could she understand it all at once?

22:22.480 --> 22:24.160
If it weren't for Old Madam's insistence,

22:24.240 --> 22:26.080
we should've let her stay home
for another year.

22:26.160 --> 22:27.880
She's already in the School of Integrity.

22:27.960 --> 22:30.040
There will be more troubles in the future.

22:30.880 --> 22:32.360
I didn't realize what could happen.

22:33.360 --> 22:35.000
I really didn't expect this.

22:35.560 --> 22:36.800
Dear, forget it.

22:36.880 --> 22:39.040
Don't be too harsh on Li'er later.

22:39.120 --> 22:40.560
Young people are always impulsive.

22:40.640 --> 22:42.120
It's inevitable.

22:42.760 --> 22:43.760
If she admits her mistake,

22:44.280 --> 22:45.720
we can slowly guide her later on.

22:45.800 --> 22:47.600
If she could admit her mistake,

22:47.680 --> 22:49.680
we wouldn't have sent her to Zhennv Hall.

22:53.320 --> 22:55.000
I want to see

22:55.080 --> 22:56.560
if she has truly repented

22:56.640 --> 22:59.000
in the past ten years!

23:00.320 --> 23:01.200
Dear.

23:02.360 --> 23:03.200
Dear.

23:03.880 --> 23:05.000
Dear,

23:05.080 --> 23:06.280
don't be angry.

23:24.960 --> 23:25.800
He's coming.

23:29.880 --> 23:31.520
My lady.

23:31.600 --> 23:32.440
Don't help me up.

23:32.520 --> 23:34.560
My lord, she has been kneeling
all day and night.

23:34.640 --> 23:35.640
Please talk to her.

23:37.680 --> 23:38.520
Father.

23:38.600 --> 23:40.120
What are you doing?

23:41.080 --> 23:42.360
I made a mistake,

23:43.680 --> 23:44.760
so I must accept punishment.

23:44.840 --> 23:46.280
Why did you do it

23:46.360 --> 23:47.720
when you knew it was wrong?

23:48.400 --> 23:50.360
Because as the daughter
of the Chief Secretariat,

23:52.400 --> 23:54.000
I shouldn't embarrass you.

23:54.840 --> 23:58.360
My dignity is not something
that's easily lost.

23:58.440 --> 24:00.040
But what about your own dignity?

24:00.120 --> 24:01.520
You made a bet

24:01.600 --> 24:03.040
and it's with the Li family.

24:03.720 --> 24:04.760
If you lose,

24:05.440 --> 24:06.880
you'll become a joke!

24:07.840 --> 24:08.680
Father,

24:09.880 --> 24:11.880
all I want is to study quietly.

24:13.560 --> 24:16.720
But the Annual Exam's rule
at the School of Integrity changed.

24:17.280 --> 24:18.800
If I don't form a team for the exam,

24:19.280 --> 24:21.240
I won't even have the qualification
to participate.

24:21.920 --> 24:23.680
I just entered the School of Integrity

24:23.760 --> 24:24.920
and have no friends.

24:26.080 --> 24:28.680
My sisters have their own ideas as well.

24:30.680 --> 24:33.120
I finally found someone to form a team,

24:34.960 --> 24:37.920
but the Li brothers
were trying to snatch him away.

24:38.720 --> 24:40.320
Their attitude is terrible

24:40.400 --> 24:41.920
and their words are contemptuous.

24:43.560 --> 24:44.640
They said…

24:46.720 --> 24:47.760
They said…

24:49.440 --> 24:50.520
What did they say?

24:51.280 --> 24:53.560
They said that if I couldn't continue
to study in school,

24:54.720 --> 24:56.800
I'd have to kneel and apologize.

24:56.880 --> 24:58.120
That is out of line!

24:58.600 --> 24:59.680
You don't need to worry.

25:00.280 --> 25:01.880
I'll surely handle it for you.

25:02.560 --> 25:03.680
Father,

25:03.760 --> 25:06.000
Chancellor Li can't do anything
to you in court,

25:06.080 --> 25:07.840
so he's using me to provoke you.

25:08.400 --> 25:09.680
If I withdraw,

25:09.760 --> 25:11.160
what about your dignity?

25:11.240 --> 25:12.600
Don't worry about these things.

25:13.160 --> 25:15.440
I'll talk to Li Zhongnan tomorrow

25:15.960 --> 25:17.160
and cancel this bet.

25:17.720 --> 25:19.680
The bet has already spread in the capital.

25:19.760 --> 25:22.840
If you deal with it for me,
you'll surely be criticized.

25:22.920 --> 25:25.360
I don't want you to be humiliated
in front of Chancellor Li.

25:26.080 --> 25:27.120
Father,

25:27.960 --> 25:29.120
I'm all grown up.

25:30.560 --> 25:32.040
You've protected me for many years.

25:32.600 --> 25:34.920
Let me take a gamble now.

25:36.000 --> 25:37.160
I accepted this bet,

25:38.160 --> 25:39.520
risking my fate

25:40.240 --> 25:42.480
and the honor of being a daughter
of the Jiang family.

25:43.240 --> 25:44.080
Father,

25:45.160 --> 25:46.360
please help me.

26:03.160 --> 26:04.160
Jiang Li,

26:04.240 --> 26:06.200
I'm giving this guqin to you.

26:06.760 --> 26:08.560
Since Father has spoken,

26:08.640 --> 26:11.080
I'll help you.

26:11.160 --> 26:12.840
If there's anything else
you need help with,

26:12.920 --> 26:13.920
feel free to let me know.

26:14.000 --> 26:17.480
The guqin you've used
can definitely help me win.

26:18.840 --> 26:20.560
You can have this music score too.

26:20.640 --> 26:22.280
It's too bad I don't play the guqin,

26:22.360 --> 26:23.680
so I can't help you much.

26:23.760 --> 26:25.800
I'm already grateful

26:25.880 --> 26:27.240
for the thought.

26:27.320 --> 26:29.000
Time is running out.

26:29.080 --> 26:30.040
Jiang Li,

26:30.120 --> 26:31.960
you need to prepare quickly.

26:41.960 --> 26:42.800
Madam Ji,

26:43.320 --> 26:45.560
we've sent good things to her.

26:45.640 --> 26:47.000
Are we really going to help her?

26:47.880 --> 26:48.960
Yes.

26:49.040 --> 26:50.120
Why not?

26:51.080 --> 26:53.080
She wants to soar high, right?

26:54.480 --> 26:58.440
Then we'll let her crash and burn.

27:00.160 --> 27:01.840
What a bunch of hypocrites.

27:01.920 --> 27:03.840
I thought Uncle Yuanbai
would scold you harshly.

27:04.720 --> 27:06.280
But in the end, he quite supports you.

27:07.120 --> 27:09.120
Everyone has grievances.

27:10.160 --> 27:11.120
Father is also human.

27:12.440 --> 27:14.240
I'm really curious.

27:14.320 --> 27:15.640
What are you good at?

27:18.240 --> 27:19.280
Do you also play the guqin?

27:20.880 --> 27:22.240
I learned a bit at Zhennv Hall.

27:28.840 --> 27:31.120
Your sister can't even
afford decent jewelry

27:31.600 --> 27:33.520
and you're spending money
to repair her guqin.

27:35.520 --> 27:37.680
I'll give my sister jewelry in the future.

27:37.760 --> 27:38.680
Mother, don't worry.

27:38.760 --> 27:41.280
But if this guqin isn't repaired soon,
her skills will worsen.

27:41.360 --> 27:42.680
It'll be too late then.

27:42.760 --> 27:43.960
I knew it.

27:44.760 --> 27:46.800
You don't care about me
and your sister at all.

27:47.400 --> 27:50.560
We might as well be dead!

27:51.200 --> 27:52.800
Mother, what are you doing?

27:52.880 --> 27:54.200
Why are you being unreasonable?

27:54.280 --> 27:55.560
Leave me alone!

28:11.680 --> 28:13.960
You call that learning a bit?

28:14.600 --> 28:16.040
You clearly play very well.

28:22.400 --> 28:23.720
- My lady.
- What's wrong?

28:24.920 --> 28:25.880
My lady.

28:27.440 --> 28:28.480
Is your wrist hurt?

28:28.560 --> 28:30.200
See a physician. I'll get one.

28:30.280 --> 28:31.360
There's no need.

28:32.760 --> 28:34.320
I'll go to the physician myself.

28:34.400 --> 28:35.280
No.

28:35.880 --> 28:36.720
I'll accompany you.

28:36.800 --> 28:37.680
My lady.

28:39.360 --> 28:40.200
It's all right.

28:41.120 --> 28:41.960
Let's go.

28:48.760 --> 28:50.520
Your fingertips are just scratched.

28:50.600 --> 28:51.640
It's not so serious.

28:52.720 --> 28:53.840
Tell us properly.

28:54.440 --> 28:56.160
She's a Chancellor's daughter.

28:56.240 --> 28:58.000
I'll hold you responsible
if she's not cured.

28:59.600 --> 29:02.520
But she has an old injury on her wrist.

29:03.080 --> 29:03.920
An old injury?

29:07.120 --> 29:07.960
Yes.

29:08.440 --> 29:11.120
The old injury wasn't treated properly
and now there's a new one.

29:12.120 --> 29:13.480
It's a bit troublesome.

29:14.040 --> 29:15.600
But don't worry too much.

29:16.200 --> 29:17.640
With daily acupuncture for a few days

29:17.720 --> 29:19.480
and the medicine I prescribed,

29:19.560 --> 29:21.560
along with proper rest
and no strenuous activity,

29:21.640 --> 29:22.520
playing the guqin

29:23.160 --> 29:25.360
and riding horses
won't be a problem later on.

29:25.440 --> 29:28.520
Sir, how long will it take
to fully recover?

29:28.600 --> 29:30.080
At least a month, I'd say.

29:30.160 --> 29:31.480
Can't it be faster?

29:31.560 --> 29:32.680
We're treating an injury.

29:32.760 --> 29:33.840
It's not child's play.

29:33.920 --> 29:35.720
It needs to be done step by step.

29:38.040 --> 29:38.880
Thank you, sir.

29:39.560 --> 29:40.760
Please prepare the medicine.

29:40.840 --> 29:41.680
All right.

29:41.760 --> 29:48.160
DIVINE TECHNIQUES

29:55.880 --> 29:57.200
Why do you have an old injury?

30:07.680 --> 30:11.440
I got injured from working hard
day and night at Zhennv Hall. Why?

30:12.920 --> 30:14.120
I mean,

30:14.600 --> 30:16.400
you knew about your wrist injury.

30:16.880 --> 30:19.440
Why did you make a bet
with the Li brothers?

30:19.520 --> 30:20.680
- I even bet--
- So

30:21.480 --> 30:23.080
are you just going to stand by and watch?

30:25.200 --> 30:26.360
That's not what I meant.

30:27.280 --> 30:28.120
No.

30:30.320 --> 30:31.880
I'm serious.

30:31.960 --> 30:33.240
I'm really serious.

30:33.320 --> 30:35.080
My father
was one of the top chess players.

30:35.160 --> 30:37.880
After he joined the officialdom,

30:37.960 --> 30:40.920
my mother thought playing chess
would affect his career,

30:41.000 --> 30:42.240
so she forbade him from playing.

30:43.040 --> 30:44.440
But I learned a few tricks from him

30:44.520 --> 30:45.880
since I was little.

30:45.960 --> 30:47.200
I'm confident

30:47.280 --> 30:48.440
I can handle it.

30:48.520 --> 30:49.720
Let's go home and play.

30:51.040 --> 30:52.400
You even know how to play chess?

30:52.960 --> 30:55.120
Why do they teach everything
at Zhennv Hall?

30:55.720 --> 30:57.120
It makes me want to go there too.

30:57.200 --> 30:58.200
Young Master,

30:58.280 --> 31:00.320
could you please check
if the medicine is ready?

31:00.400 --> 31:02.280
My lady needs to take it.

31:02.360 --> 31:03.680
Of course. I'll go and get it.

31:04.600 --> 31:05.440
Is it ready yet?

31:07.880 --> 31:10.480
Miss, how can you play the guqin
with your wrist like this?

31:13.200 --> 31:14.560
There's always a way.

31:16.320 --> 31:18.080
Let's take care of the others first.

31:52.840 --> 31:55.880
Is your son sick?

31:58.160 --> 31:59.960
He seems to have it bad.

33:03.360 --> 33:04.200
Xu'er,

33:05.600 --> 33:06.840
I have some free time today.

33:06.920 --> 33:08.680
I can play with you.

33:09.440 --> 33:11.200
I must prepare for the exam.
Don't disturb me.

33:12.040 --> 33:15.000
Pigs might fly today.

33:31.840 --> 33:33.600
She's really overestimating herself.

33:55.760 --> 33:56.600
Jiang Li.

33:57.080 --> 33:57.960
What is it?

33:58.040 --> 34:01.000
How do you have the courage
to compete for first place?

34:02.280 --> 34:03.280
Because I can't accept it.

34:03.840 --> 34:05.480
I can't accept being stuck in Zhennv Hall,

34:05.560 --> 34:07.320
being trampled on
at the School of Integrity,

34:07.400 --> 34:10.280
and being hidden away at home

34:10.360 --> 34:11.480
just to marry a good husband.

34:11.560 --> 34:12.800
I want to compete.

34:12.880 --> 34:15.000
I want to break free
from this stifling place

34:15.080 --> 34:16.280
and fight for justice.

34:17.000 --> 34:18.280
There's nothing to hide about it.

34:18.360 --> 34:19.760
Now I know

34:19.840 --> 34:21.520
why you managed to convince Ye Shijie.

34:21.600 --> 34:22.840
You have a determination.

34:23.360 --> 34:24.320
Only you

34:24.400 --> 34:26.400
can persuade
such a proud person to join us.

34:26.480 --> 34:28.600
I told you. I want to win against Li Lian.

34:28.679 --> 34:30.560
Shijie also deserves His Majesty's
reward at the palace hall.

34:30.639 --> 34:33.360
This time, whether it's for me,

34:34.040 --> 34:35.080
for him,

34:35.159 --> 34:36.040
or for us,

34:36.960 --> 34:38.600
I'm going all out.

34:39.679 --> 34:41.679
Me too. I'll give it my all.

34:46.840 --> 34:47.920
What's wrong?

34:48.000 --> 34:49.480
I fell off a horse before.

34:49.560 --> 34:51.000
I didn't want to ride again.

34:51.080 --> 34:53.120
Now, I want to try again.

34:53.199 --> 34:55.600
Liu Xu, don't worry.

34:55.679 --> 34:56.719
I'll ride with you.

34:56.800 --> 34:58.840
Let's get used to riding
on horseback first.

35:16.840 --> 35:17.720
It's all right.

35:17.800 --> 35:18.800
No rush. Take your time.

35:20.000 --> 35:21.640
Your thumb ring is loose.

35:22.400 --> 35:23.840
Don't you know that?

35:23.920 --> 35:25.080
Duke Su?

35:25.800 --> 35:26.680
You were following me.

35:26.760 --> 35:27.960
To you,

35:28.680 --> 35:30.200
am I such a lame person?

35:30.280 --> 35:32.360
This place is usually for hunting.

35:32.440 --> 35:33.320
As for you two,

35:33.400 --> 35:35.040
it's quite dangerous
to barge in like this.

35:35.120 --> 35:37.000
We couldn't find anywhere else.

35:37.080 --> 35:38.080
Duke Su,

35:38.160 --> 35:40.320
what did you say about Liu Xu?

35:40.840 --> 35:41.680
What's loose?

35:43.880 --> 35:46.080
This friend of yours
deliberately wore a loose thumb ring

35:46.160 --> 35:48.240
because of an old thumb injury.

35:48.320 --> 35:49.480
What she doesn't know is that

35:49.560 --> 35:51.120
if the ring doesn't stick to the skin,

35:51.200 --> 35:52.120
the ring will rotate

35:52.200 --> 35:54.440
due to friction
with the arrow shaft when shooting.

35:54.520 --> 35:56.680
Before the arrow leaves the bow,
its direction is already off.

35:56.760 --> 35:59.040
A slight deviation can lead
to a huge difference.

35:59.120 --> 36:00.440
How can you shoot accurately?

36:19.440 --> 36:20.480
That's really impressive.

36:21.840 --> 36:22.680
Do you know archery?

36:24.040 --> 36:24.880
No.

36:24.960 --> 36:26.720
A bow and arrow are light weapons.

36:26.800 --> 36:28.240
It's good for women
to learn it for self-defense.

36:28.320 --> 36:29.520
Get off the horse and stand here.

36:35.280 --> 36:36.120
Hold this for me.

36:36.200 --> 36:38.160
- I never said I wanted to learn it.
- Do as I say.

36:52.240 --> 36:54.040
Hold the bow's center with one hand.

36:59.480 --> 37:00.800
Hold it firmly

37:00.880 --> 37:02.400
without looseness.

37:03.360 --> 37:05.600
Pull the string with your thumb.

37:08.280 --> 37:09.240
Just like this.

37:09.880 --> 37:12.000
Remember the position
of your thumb pulling the string.

37:12.080 --> 37:13.200
I'll guide you to pull the bow once.

37:16.760 --> 37:18.200
When holding the bow, hold it tight.

37:18.720 --> 37:20.960
Or you'll be giving a chance
for your opponent to kill you.

37:26.600 --> 37:27.520
Focus on the target.

37:28.200 --> 37:29.360
I'll count to three.

37:29.440 --> 37:30.440
Together, let's release

37:30.520 --> 37:32.400
the thumb that's pulling the string.

37:32.480 --> 37:33.680
Remember.

37:33.760 --> 37:34.600
Don't hesitate.

37:35.080 --> 37:38.680
One, two, three.

37:41.600 --> 37:42.680
I really hit it.

37:45.920 --> 37:46.840
Try it yourself.

38:01.440 --> 38:03.520
- What's wrong with your wrist?
- It's nothing.

38:07.640 --> 38:09.080
How is an injury like that nothing?

38:09.560 --> 38:10.920
How are you going to take the exam?

38:13.560 --> 38:14.880
I'm already treating it.

38:15.440 --> 38:16.680
Duke Su, you don't have to worry.

38:16.760 --> 38:19.160
The physician said it'll take
at least a month to fully heal.

38:19.240 --> 38:20.480
Can you wait that long?

38:20.560 --> 38:21.880
And you say you're not spying on me.

38:23.080 --> 38:24.560
I was just passing by.

38:29.200 --> 38:30.480
Jiang Li, what's wrong?

38:42.120 --> 38:43.400
Come to my residence today

38:43.480 --> 38:45.480
if you want to be completely healed.

38:57.280 --> 38:58.400
What's wrong with your wrist?

38:59.920 --> 39:00.760
Don't worry.

39:01.240 --> 39:02.120
It's nothing serious.

39:03.320 --> 39:05.720
I was wondering why Duke Su
came to give me some pointers.

39:05.800 --> 39:06.800
So you know each other.

39:07.480 --> 39:09.440
I even heard he invited you
to his residence.

39:10.880 --> 39:12.040
You're not going, are you?

39:12.600 --> 39:15.360
The Annual Exam is in three days, right?

39:16.000 --> 39:16.920
Yes.

39:17.000 --> 39:19.080
Duke Su is a strange person.

39:19.160 --> 39:20.560
Although he helped us today,

39:20.640 --> 39:22.280
who knows what he's thinking?

39:22.360 --> 39:23.960
It's best not to provoke him.

39:25.440 --> 39:26.280
All right.

39:44.040 --> 39:45.040
Miss,

39:45.120 --> 39:46.440
why don't you rest for a bit?

39:46.520 --> 39:48.440
You can't rush it with your wrist injury.

39:49.040 --> 39:50.280
We're running out of time.

39:50.360 --> 39:51.960
You still have Ms. Liu, right?

39:52.040 --> 39:53.760
See if any of them can play the guqin

39:53.840 --> 39:54.760
and swap with you.

39:59.680 --> 40:00.520
DUKE SU'S MANSION

40:00.600 --> 40:01.880
Please relay a message.

40:02.360 --> 40:03.600
Duke Su told me to come.

40:07.920 --> 40:09.600
His lordship asked you to come yesterday.

40:09.680 --> 40:10.960
He waited all day.

40:11.600 --> 40:13.240
He doesn't want to see any visitors today.

40:15.320 --> 40:16.640
I arrived late

40:16.720 --> 40:18.160
and made Duke Su wait.

40:18.880 --> 40:22.240
Today, I will wait for him instead.

40:28.080 --> 40:29.120
Close the door.

40:42.880 --> 40:46.320
DUKE SU'S MANSION

40:49.280 --> 40:53.680
DUKE SU'S MANSION

40:58.440 --> 40:59.280
Ms. Jiang Li,

41:01.280 --> 41:02.360
follow me.

41:05.760 --> 41:06.680
Wait.

41:06.760 --> 41:09.440
- What's wrong?
- My legs are numb from sitting too long.

41:09.520 --> 41:10.560
I can't stand up.

41:23.280 --> 41:24.680
RETURN OF THE CLOUDS

41:35.360 --> 41:36.840
Duke Su, you're in a good mood today.

41:37.320 --> 41:38.880
But I didn't come here

41:38.960 --> 41:40.560
for roast meat.

41:40.640 --> 41:41.600
Since you're not hungry,

41:42.240 --> 41:43.400
wait first.

41:43.880 --> 41:45.080
The physician hasn't eaten yet.

41:57.040 --> 42:00.760
SITU JIUYUE

42:02.400 --> 42:03.520
Let me introduce you

42:03.600 --> 42:06.080
to the best physician in the land.

42:06.640 --> 42:08.360
I'm not the best physician,

42:08.440 --> 42:09.840
but the best poison expert.

42:13.320 --> 42:14.160
Xiao Heng,

42:14.240 --> 42:16.040
why did you just bring someone here

42:16.120 --> 42:17.000
for me to heal?

42:17.480 --> 42:18.640
Do you want to break my rules?

42:18.720 --> 42:20.600
I won't break your rules.

42:20.680 --> 42:21.720
I'll do it on her behalf.

42:21.800 --> 42:23.120
You'll do it on her behalf?

42:23.800 --> 42:24.800
Who is she to you?

42:27.120 --> 42:28.400
What's the rule?

42:30.720 --> 42:32.000
Xiao Heng hasn't told you, right?

42:32.080 --> 42:34.200
If you want me to heal you,

42:34.280 --> 42:35.920
you need to gamble with me first.

42:36.880 --> 42:38.560
If you're willing to heal me,

42:39.320 --> 42:40.400
I'd naturally take that bet.

42:40.480 --> 42:41.320
Fine.

42:41.400 --> 42:42.480
You're straightforward.

42:59.240 --> 43:01.800
My new venomous spider happens
to need someone to test its poison.

43:02.280 --> 43:03.400
If you win against me,

43:03.480 --> 43:05.080
I'll heal your hand.

43:05.160 --> 43:06.320
What if I lose?

43:07.320 --> 43:08.480
You'll give your life to me.

43:14.320 --> 43:15.160
How do we do this?

43:16.480 --> 43:21.200
Among these two spiders,
one is poisonous, the other is not.

43:22.760 --> 43:24.040
Pick one.

43:25.360 --> 43:26.240
Sometimes,

43:26.320 --> 43:28.000
staying alive requires luck.

43:28.480 --> 43:30.640
Or even if I save you this time,

43:31.360 --> 43:32.640
you might not live long.

43:35.360 --> 43:36.760
Let me remind you.

43:36.840 --> 43:38.400
One of these is highly poisonous.

43:39.040 --> 43:40.840
If you pick the wrong one

43:40.920 --> 43:42.360
and it bites you,

43:43.440 --> 43:45.400
you might not survive.

43:49.440 --> 43:50.320
Shall we start?

43:51.520 --> 43:52.640
Wait.

43:53.680 --> 43:57.200
- Are you scared?
- You said I need to bet on a life.

43:57.840 --> 44:00.640
But you didn't say it had to be my own.

44:06.920 --> 44:08.240
This is the life I'm betting on.

44:09.880 --> 44:12.000
I introduced a physician to you.

44:12.080 --> 44:13.720
You're repaying kindness with enmity.

44:13.800 --> 44:15.640
If anything happens to you,

44:15.720 --> 44:17.120
I will take my own life in return.

44:17.680 --> 44:18.640
You'll die with me?

44:25.720 --> 44:27.560
Xiao Heng, I'm warning you.

44:28.200 --> 44:29.760
This spider is truly poisonous.

44:31.440 --> 44:32.400
What are we waiting for?

44:32.480 --> 44:34.400
Let me carefully pick

44:34.480 --> 44:36.320
which one is the venomous spider.

44:39.240 --> 44:40.080
Is it this one?

44:48.040 --> 44:49.080
Or is it this one?

44:54.000 --> 44:54.920
Open it.

44:56.920 --> 44:57.760
Open it.

45:07.040 --> 45:07.880
It's not poisonous.

45:12.240 --> 45:13.080
Xiao Heng.

45:19.920 --> 45:20.920
Then I'll pick this one.

45:22.680 --> 45:23.680
Open it.

45:26.200 --> 45:27.040
You won.

45:27.760 --> 45:28.920
This is not poisonous.

45:29.600 --> 45:31.600
It looks like my hand gave you luck.

45:37.080 --> 45:37.920
Get out.

45:38.000 --> 45:39.240
I need to do the treatment now.

45:41.240 --> 45:42.320
What a shame.

45:42.400 --> 45:43.480
You can't die with me.

45:44.440 --> 45:45.600
Can you walk quickly?

45:53.160 --> 45:54.240
How did you guess?

45:54.320 --> 45:57.120
When you look at him,
I can see affection in your eyes.

45:57.880 --> 45:58.880
So what?

46:00.040 --> 46:00.880
Aren't you the same?

46:00.960 --> 46:02.520
He isn't the one I love.

46:03.880 --> 46:05.360
If you dare to lie to me,

46:06.040 --> 46:08.000
I'll kill you.

46:08.600 --> 46:09.960
Women shouldn't easily show affection.

46:10.040 --> 46:12.240
Otherwise, they'll lose the first round.

46:13.000 --> 46:14.640
You speak as if you've lost before.

46:15.240 --> 46:16.280
Give me your hand.

46:32.560 --> 46:34.120
Your meridians are in disarray.

46:34.200 --> 46:36.600
Ordinary methods won't work.
We can only fight poison with poison.

46:36.680 --> 46:38.600
But this method is intense.

46:38.680 --> 46:40.360
You'll endure immense pain,

46:40.440 --> 46:41.440
mental turmoil,

46:41.920 --> 46:42.760
and sleepless nights.

46:42.840 --> 46:44.160
I trust you, Ms. Situ.

46:45.520 --> 46:46.760
You're quite bold.

46:47.920 --> 46:50.600
No wonder Xiao Heng came
to beg me for you.

46:50.680 --> 46:53.280
You and Duke Su seem well-acquainted.

46:53.360 --> 46:55.200
We saved each other before.

47:12.080 --> 47:12.920
Give me your hand.

48:14.880 --> 48:17.760
DUKE SU'S MANSION

48:30.480 --> 48:31.480
Did you stay up all night?

48:32.520 --> 48:33.920
Are you worried that I'd poison her?

48:34.000 --> 48:35.040
How is she?

48:36.120 --> 48:37.800
The poison hasn't
completely dissipated yet.

48:37.880 --> 48:39.080
Give it two more days

48:39.160 --> 48:40.280
and she'll fully recover.

48:42.560 --> 48:43.400
Xiao Heng,

48:44.680 --> 48:45.920
I never imagined

48:46.640 --> 48:48.480
that you would care so much for a woman.

48:48.560 --> 48:50.320
She's the actress I want to groom.

48:50.960 --> 48:53.320
If her hand is crippled,
how can she continue with her act?

48:54.760 --> 48:55.600
Xiao Heng,

48:56.720 --> 48:58.800
have you developed feelings for her?

49:01.880 --> 49:03.160
Stop asking me such questions.

49:09.640 --> 49:11.960
You'd better not let me find out
you're lying to me.

49:21.960 --> 49:22.800
Lu Ji,

49:25.760 --> 49:27.200
bring Ms. Jiang Li home.

49:27.840 --> 49:28.680
She's asleep.

49:29.280 --> 49:30.640
Do you want me to carry her back

49:31.240 --> 49:32.400
or throw her over my shoulder?

49:33.320 --> 49:35.000
Send a message to her maid.

49:35.080 --> 49:35.960
Yes.

50:43.680 --> 50:44.520
How are you feeling?

50:49.400 --> 50:51.280
Thank you for getting me a physician.

50:52.600 --> 50:54.000
I will repay this favor

50:54.560 --> 50:56.240
in the future.

50:56.320 --> 50:57.160
You can't repay

50:58.000 --> 50:59.320
my favor yet.

50:59.400 --> 51:00.560
What do you mean?

51:00.640 --> 51:02.080
When people are down and out,

51:03.520 --> 51:04.600
they're like falling leaves

51:05.520 --> 51:06.680
who can't control

51:07.960 --> 51:09.440
their fate.

51:18.640 --> 51:21.760
The Duke Mansion has no place
for such falling leaves.
